## 1. Company in one line
Fuso makes ultra-high-purity colloidal silica (abrasive particles for polishing chips, brand Quartron®) sold mainly to CMP slurry formulators, plus fruit acids (malic, citric, gluconic, fumaric), vitamin C and food-additive formulations for food, beverage, industrial and pharma users. Electronic Materials is 54% of FY03/2026 sales and 75% of segment operating profit; the business is a "global niche top" player with 55.1% overseas sales [D: Deck26 P5-7; Yuho26 P99; Corp P4].

